    "hub": {
      "text": "里正说给你两天，我给你半盏茶的耐心。问吧，但若你只是替自己洗清，我会把这盏茶泼回去。",
      "emotion": "trembling",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "……你查清楚了？王大爷是假证？那……那老爷到底是怎么死的？",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_wife",
          "emotion": "interrogating",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "self_cleared"
            },
            {
              "not_flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "阿贵认了？他……他承认是他害了老爷？",
          "speaker_id": "zhou_wife",
          "emotion": "interrogating",
          "requires": [
            {
              "flag": "agui_confessed_mastermind"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "说说你丈夫",
